  "note": [
   "From the law: the proportion, in Article 7 of the Act, the construction, in Article 6 of the decree, and the CIE and Munsell values, in the decree's Annex 2.",
   "Derived: the red and blue hex values were converted for this file from Annex 2's CIE values to sRGB, assuming D65, since the annex doesn't name an illuminant. Black and white are plain, and Annex 2 gives them only as Munsell values.",
   "From elsewhere: the Pantone values aren't in the law. FOTW reports them from a 1997 ministry document and from the Album des Pavillons.",
   "Article 5 of the decree lets the proportion differ at celebrations and along streets, with no figures, so this file has no variant for that.",
   "Amendments: the national law center's current texts are the Act as of 28 January 2014 (No. 12342) and the decree as of 26 July 2017 (No. 28211). Wikisource's 2014 decree has the same Article 6."
